{"ID":"20240205164748-3uymqfr","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205164748-3uymqfr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164748-3uymqfr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100958-6klbfz8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101039-mvlo0jb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101044-fo6if80\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:130,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:130\u0026#125;","title":"莲子","type":"doc","updated":"20240902170127"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206100958-6klbfz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100958-6klbfz8","updated":"20240206101001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖南、湖北、福建、江苏、浙江、江西等地。\n【性状】\t本品略呈椭圆形或类球形，长1.21.8cm，直径0.81.4cm。表面浅黄棕色至红棕色，有细纵纹和较宽的脉纹。一端中心呈乳头状突起，深棕色，多有裂口，其周边略下陷。质硬，种皮薄，不易剥离。子叶2，黄白色，肥厚，中有空隙，具绿色莲子心。无臭，味甘、微涩；莲子心味苦。\n【性味】\t甘、涩，平。\n【功效】\t补脾止泻，益肾涩精，养心安神。用于脾虚久泻，遗精带下，心悸失眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100953-vtrrtti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100953-vtrrtti","updated":"20240206100953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100953-yx4hkba.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165250-dxwpcb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165250-dxwpcb3","updated":"20240205165250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莲子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莲子-20240205165250-tojyl84.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161401-6nprqzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161401-6nprqzg","updated":"20240724161401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240724160926-oubnbhh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161401-cr70zd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161401-cr70zd7","updated":"20240724161401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621115618-6nq1xik.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621115625-x18qwzp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 433px;\" parent-style=\"width: 443px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 346px;","style":"width: 336px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621124313-1g6qc7s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 336px;\" parent-style=\"width: 346px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161401-fqx2gon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"202407